  "description": "Tutorial completo para o aplicativo PASS em Android e Computador.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-green-600/10 border-l-4 border-green-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-green-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-gift'></i> Ativação Gratuita TopTV</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O aplicativo PASS é parceiro oficial do nosso servidor. Usando nossos códigos, você não paga taxas extras.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Login via Provider ID</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Na tela inicial do PASS, selecione a opção de login via <b>Provider ID</b> (ou Código de Fornecedor).</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Códigos Oficiais</h4><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-blue-500/30 p-6 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-xl mb-4'><div class='grid grid-cols-2 gap-4'><div class='p-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-xl'><b>4100</b><br><small>Rota Principal</small></div><div class='p-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-xl'><b>4101</b><br><small>Rota Internacional</small></div><div class='p-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-xl'><b>4102</b><br><small>Alternativa 2</small></div><div class='p-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-xl'><b>4103</b><br><small>Alternativa 3</small></div><div class='col-span-2 p-2 bg-gray-900 rounded-xl'><b>4104</b><br><small>Alternativa 4</small></div></div></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Usuário e Senha</h4><p class='text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed'>Após inserir o código, basta colocar seu Usuário e Senha de teste ou assinatura.</p></section></div>"
  }
}